From e399e54cc6816db191bd46ec6d2aca764df208e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 22:44:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02205/11362] [outer-loop] graph-explore adapter-free fallback
 in the standing ARC loop

arc_loop_solve.py un-adaptered path now: graph_explore_solve (adapter-free, GameGraph
+ salience _action_candidates) -> if it advances a level: capture trajectory ->
reproduction-gate -> train verifier-seed (generic grid features) -> persist trajectory
as the adapter seed -> next solve is verifier-routed. Falls through to routing-RE if no
advance. Downstream pipeline VALIDATED (r11l trajectory -> L1 reproduced + verifier-seed).
Basic explorer is WEAK on our games (centroid-clicks miss exact coords / keyboard needs
deep search) -- upgrade path = SOTA 2512.24156, no loop rewiring needed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
